                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td width="50%" style="padding: 2px;">
                    <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6931dc4e8e97334e195432df/6931e337bae1852f49748471_IMG_0245.JPG" alt="Pool Work" style="width: 100%; max-width: 150px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; display: block;">
                  </td>
