                    <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6931dc4e8e97334e195432df/6931e338284101d720d63847_IMG_0059.JPG" alt="Pool Work" style="width: 100%; max-width: 150px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; display: block;">
